# Resumable real-LLM experiment progress (spent/deleted on completion)
data/checkpoint_real_llm_*.jsonl

# v2.1 confirmatory campaign runtime state: receipts, per-arm checkpoints,
# observation archives, and operator wrapper scripts -- some of these
# (auto_resume.sh) embed a live API key inline for a background retry
# loop; none of this is source, all of it is regenerated by re-running
# the campaign, and none of it should ever reach a commit. Globbed
# (runs*/, not just runs/) so a revision's own output dir (runs_v2/,
# and any future runs_v3/, ...) is covered automatically -- found on
# 2026-08-20 that runs_v2/ was NOT covered by the old literal pattern,
# leaving its auto_resume.sh (a live API key inline) one `git add -A`
# away from being committed.
data/protocol_v2_1/runs*/

